{"id":"forecast-06","section":3,"path":"bank/listening/forecast-06/audio-3.mp3","model":"small","duration":449.96,"segments":[{"start":0.3,"end":8.38,"text":"Section 3. You will hear two psychology students called Katie and Daniel discussing how taking","words":[["Section",0.3,0.92],["3.",0.92,1.5],["You",2.36,2.98],["will",2.98,3.14],["hear",3.14,3.36],["two",3.36,3.7],["psychology",3.7,4.36],["students",4.36,5.0],["called",5.0,5.72],["Katie",5.72,6.14],["and",6.14,6.42],["Daniel",6.42,6.76],["discussing",6.76,7.52],["how",7.52,8.02],["taking",8.02,8.38]]},{"start":8.38,"end":12.82,"text":"a walk can affect people's creativity and physical well-being.","words":[["a",8.38,8.62],["walk",8.62,8.88],["can",8.88,9.36],["affect",9.36,9.68],["people's",9.68,10.3],["creativity",10.3,10.84],["and",10.84,11.58],["physical",11.58,12.04],["well",12.04,12.44],["-being.",12.44,12.82]]},{"start":13.92,"end":68.03,"text":"First, you have some time to look at questions 21 to 26 on page 5. Now listen carefully and","words":[["First,",13.92,14.82],["you",15.18,15.36],["have",15.36,15.56],["some",15.56,15.76],["time",15.76,16.14],["to",16.14,16.38],["look",16.38,16.52],["at",16.52,16.68],["questions",16.68,17.08],["21",17.08,18.1],["to",18.1,18.54],["26",18.54,19.14],["on",19.14,19.96],["page",19.96,20.22],["5.",20.22,20.74],["Now",66.47,66.73],["listen",66.73,67.05],["carefully",67.05,67.49],["and",67.49,68.03]]},{"start":68.03,"end":70.83,"text":"answer questions 21 to 26.","words":[["answer",68.03,68.29],["questions",68.29,68.75],["21",68.75,69.75],["to",69.75,70.23],["26.",70.23,70.83]]},{"start":70.83,"end":75.28,"text":"Hi Daniel.","words":[["Hi",70.83,71.95],["Daniel.",74.96,75.28]]},{"start":75.7,"end":78.54,"text":"Katie, you look as if you're off somewhere.","words":[["Katie,",75.7,76.2],["you",77.1,77.32],["look",77.32,77.54],["as",77.54,77.72],["if",77.72,77.88],["you're",77.88,78.08],["off",78.08,78.2],["somewhere.",78.2,78.54]]},{"start":78.98,"end":81.54,"text":"Yes, I was just heading out for a walk.","words":[["Yes,",78.98,79.3],["I",79.68,79.92],["was",79.92,80.08],["just",80.08,80.34],["heading",80.34,80.66],["out",80.66,80.94],["for",80.94,81.16],["a",81.16,81.32],["walk.",81.32,81.54]]},{"start":81.98,"end":89.1,"text":"Hmm, funny. I was just reading an article about some research that's been done on the effects of walking on creativity.","words":[["Hmm,",81.98,82.18],["funny.",82.36,82.52],["I",83.12,83.38],["was",83.38,83.54],["just",83.54,83.74],["reading",83.74,84.02],["an",84.02,84.26],["article",84.26,84.66],["about",84.66,84.98],["some",84.98,85.26],["research",85.26,85.62],["that's",85.62,86.08],["been",86.08,86.26],["done",86.26,86.54],["on",86.54,86.82],["the",86.82,86.96],["effects",86.96,87.3],["of",87.3,87.56],["walking",87.56,87.9],["on",87.9,88.52],["creativity.",88.52,89.1]]},{"start":89.74,"end":91.24,"text":"Sounds interesting.","words":[["Sounds",89.74,90.38],["interesting.",90.38,91.24]]},{"start":91.74,"end":98.16,"text":"I've always found walking helped me think, but this article confirms that everybody can benefit.","words":[["I've",91.74,92.04],["always",92.04,92.26],["found",92.26,92.56],["walking",92.56,93.02],["helped",93.02,93.5],["me",93.5,93.84],["think,",93.84,94.24],["but",94.74,95.0],["this",95.0,95.38],["article",95.38,95.82],["confirms",95.82,96.44],["that",96.44,96.9],["everybody",96.9,97.48],["can",97.48,97.82],["benefit.",97.82,98.16]]},{"start":98.66,"end":100.18,"text":"Oh, tell me more.","words":[["Oh,",98.66,99.02],["tell",99.42,99.68],["me",99.68,99.86],["more.",99.86,100.18]]},{"start":100.18,"end":106.42,"text":"Okay, but I may even do some more research on it at some point, so don't pinch my idea!","words":[["Okay,",100.18,100.8],["but",101.3,101.52],["I",101.52,101.96],["may",101.96,102.26],["even",102.26,102.56],["do",102.56,102.78],["some",102.78,103.0],["more",103.0,103.26],["research",103.26,103.74],["on",103.74,103.92],["it",103.92,104.02],["at",104.02,104.14],["some",104.14,104.34],["point,",104.34,104.68],["so",104.7,104.96],["don't",104.96,105.44],["pinch",105.44,105.68],["my",105.68,105.98],["idea!",105.98,106.42]]},{"start":106.7,"end":107.38,"text":"Promise!","words":[["Promise!",106.7,107.38]]},{"start":108.54,"end":114.96,"text":"Well, in the experiments, the researchers tested participants' creativity by comparing","words":[["Well,",108.54,108.84],["in",109.36,109.6],["the",109.6,109.74],["experiments,",109.74,110.38],["the",110.9,111.0],["researchers",111.0,111.5],["tested",111.5,112.16],["participants'",112.16,112.88],["creativity",113.14,113.66],["by",113.66,114.4],["comparing",114.4,114.96]]},{"start":114.96,"end":120.24,"text":"how many ideas they thought of while they were walking, compared to while they were","words":[["how",114.96,115.4],["many",115.4,115.66],["ideas",115.66,116.24],["they",116.24,116.5],["thought",116.5,116.8],["of",116.8,117.14],["while",117.14,117.74],["they",117.74,118.06],["were",118.06,118.2],["walking,",118.2,118.54],["compared",119.02,119.44],["to",119.44,119.7],["while",119.7,119.94],["they",119.94,120.14],["were",120.14,120.24]]},{"start":120.24,"end":121.54,"text":"doing other activities.","words":[["doing",120.24,120.6],["other",120.6,120.96],["activities.",120.96,121.54]]},{"start":122.06,"end":124.2,"text":"What, like listening to music?","words":[["What,",122.06,122.48],["like",122.76,123.16],["listening",123.16,123.66],["to",123.66,123.94],["music?",123.94,124.2]]},{"start":124.2,"end":130.7,"text":"Nothing like that. But they did analyse the ideas participants came up with when sitting,","words":[["Nothing",124.2,125.26],["like",125.26,125.72],["that.",125.72,126.0],["But",126.48,126.82],["they",126.82,127.02],["did",127.02,127.34],["analyse",127.34,127.8],["the",127.8,128.06],["ideas",128.06,128.48],["participants",128.48,129.12],["came",129.12,129.5],["up",129.5,129.7],["with",129.7,129.96],["when",129.96,130.2],["sitting,",130.2,130.7]]},{"start":131.24,"end":138.8,"text":"both outdoors and inside. What I found surprising was that they didn't compare walking to other","words":[["both",131.24,131.52],["outdoors",131.52,132.22],["and",132.22,132.88],["inside.",132.88,133.5],["What",134.42,134.78],["I",134.78,135.0],["found",135.0,135.24],["surprising",135.24,135.82],["was",135.82,136.32],["that",136.32,136.54],["they",136.54,136.68],["didn't",136.68,137.08],["compare",137.08,137.5],["walking",137.5,137.94],["to",137.94,138.54],["other",138.54,138.8]]},{"start":138.8,"end":145.52,"text":"forms of exercise, like running for example. Right! So what was the difference between","words":[["forms",138.8,139.08],["of",139.08,139.28],["exercise,",139.28,139.74],["like",140.06,140.4],["running",140.4,141.06],["for",141.06,141.4],["example.",141.4,141.8],["Right!",142.24,142.62],["So",143.26,143.74],["what",143.74,144.18],["was",144.18,144.4],["the",144.4,144.58],["difference",144.58,145.06],["between",145.06,145.52]]},{"start":145.52,"end":150.06,"text":"the experiments? Well, in each one the activities were put","words":[["the",145.52,145.78],["experiments?",145.78,146.24],["Well,",146.94,147.28],["in",147.64,147.84],["each",147.84,148.1],["one",148.1,148.42],["the",148.42,148.98],["activities",148.98,149.48],["were",149.48,149.88],["put",149.88,150.06]]},{"start":150.06,"end":155.94,"text":"together in different ways. Several of the experiments specifically focused on the ability","words":[["together",150.06,150.32],["in",150.32,150.7],["different",150.7,150.98],["ways.",150.98,151.36],["Several",152.18,152.68],["of",152.68,152.96],["the",152.96,153.1],["experiments",153.1,153.68],["specifically",153.68,154.5],["focused",154.5,155.08],["on",155.08,155.5],["the",155.5,155.6],["ability",155.6,155.94]]},{"start":155.94,"end":162.82,"text":"of participants to come up with new ideas. Then the final experiment was a control test","words":[["of",155.94,156.26],["participants",156.26,156.74],["to",156.74,157.46],["come",157.46,157.64],["up",157.64,157.76],["with",157.76,157.94],["new",157.94,158.18],["ideas.",158.18,158.7],["Then",159.52,159.78],["the",159.78,160.02],["final",160.02,160.46],["experiment",160.46,161.16],["was",161.16,161.76],["a",161.76,161.96],["control",161.96,162.44],["test",162.44,162.82]]},{"start":162.82,"end":170.8,"text":"of sorts. Oh right. In one experiment, participants had to think of unusual uses for three everyday","words":[["of",162.82,163.02],["sorts.",163.02,163.4],["Oh",163.76,164.02],["right.",164.02,164.34],["In",165.1,165.52],["one",165.52,165.82],["experiment,",165.82,166.64],["participants",166.94,167.48],["had",167.48,167.96],["to",167.96,168.12],["think",168.12,168.34],["of",168.34,168.48],["unusual",168.48,168.98],["uses",168.98,169.52],["for",169.52,169.86],["three",169.86,170.24],["everyday",170.24,170.8]]},{"start":170.8,"end":178.16,"text":"objects within a time limit. Okay. And then there was an experiment with words. What","words":[["objects",170.8,171.42],["within",171.42,172.04],["a",172.04,172.22],["time",172.22,172.4],["limit.",172.4,172.7],["Okay.",173.1,173.58],["And",174.12,174.74],["then",174.74,175.14],["there",175.14,175.54],["was",175.54,175.78],["an",175.78,175.92],["experiment",175.92,176.38],["with",176.38,176.74],["words.",176.74,177.16],["What",177.74,178.16]]},{"start":178.16,"end":187.2,"text":"did they ask them to do? Compare words in unusual ways. For example, the word sweet. If participants","words":[["did",178.16,178.34],["they",178.34,178.54],["ask",178.54,178.82],["them",178.82,179.0],["to",179.0,179.16],["do?",179.16,179.36],["Compare",179.8,180.36],["words",180.36,180.86],["in",180.86,181.34],["unusual",181.34,182.0],["ways.",182.0,182.48],["For",183.14,183.44],["example,",183.44,183.84],["the",184.4,184.48],["word",184.48,184.88],["sweet.",184.88,185.4],["If",186.26,186.56],["participants",186.56,187.2]]},{"start":187.2,"end":195.18,"text":"simply said sweet as sugar, that wasn't creative. But an answer like sweet as a cat with honey","words":[["simply",187.2,187.9],["said",187.9,188.32],["sweet",188.32,189.02],["as",189.02,189.24],["sugar,",189.24,189.54],["that",190.1,190.38],["wasn't",190.38,190.96],["creative.",190.96,191.46],["But",192.04,192.34],["an",192.34,192.48],["answer",192.48,192.76],["like",192.76,193.1],["sweet",193.1,193.88],["as",193.88,194.18],["a",194.18,194.28],["cat",194.28,194.56],["with",194.56,194.84],["honey",194.84,195.18]]},{"start":195.18,"end":202.28,"text":"on its paws was. Okay, I can see why they'd ask them to do that. Really? I just don't","words":[["on",195.18,195.38],["its",195.38,195.54],["paws",195.54,195.88],["was.",195.88,196.36],["Okay,",196.78,197.24],["I",197.8,198.12],["can",198.12,198.32],["see",198.32,198.6],["why",198.6,198.84],["they'd",198.84,199.06],["ask",199.06,199.32],["them",199.32,199.54],["to",199.54,199.72],["do",199.72,199.88],["that.",199.88,200.1],["Really?",200.52,200.88],["I",201.58,201.88],["just",201.88,202.06],["don't",202.06,202.28]]},{"start":202.28,"end":208.12,"text":"see how the experiment is fair. Why? Because the conclusions are based only","words":[["see",202.28,202.58],["how",202.58,202.88],["the",202.88,203.1],["experiment",203.1,203.58],["is",203.58,203.88],["fair.",203.88,204.24],["Why?",204.7,205.28],["Because",205.92,206.2],["the",206.2,206.42],["conclusions",206.42,206.98],["are",206.98,207.26],["based",207.26,207.62],["only",207.62,208.12]]},{"start":208.12,"end":212.42,"text":"on the researcher's opinion. I think it's more that anyone who'd studied","words":[["on",208.12,208.32],["the",208.32,208.44],["researcher's",208.44,209.12],["opinion.",209.12,209.4],["I",209.8,210.02],["think",210.02,210.24],["it's",210.24,210.56],["more",210.56,210.86],["that",210.86,211.14],["anyone",211.14,211.68],["who'd",211.68,212.16],["studied",212.16,212.42]]},{"start":212.42,"end":219.04,"text":"language would be at an advantage. Okay. Was there an experiment about focused","words":[["language",212.42,212.94],["would",212.94,213.3],["be",213.3,213.56],["at",213.56,213.78],["an",213.78,213.92],["advantage.",213.92,214.38],["Okay.",215.04,215.64],["Was",216.46,216.76],["there",216.76,217.02],["an",217.02,217.16],["experiment",217.16,217.72],["about",217.72,218.36],["focused",218.36,219.04]]},{"start":219.04,"end":226.58,"text":"thinking? Yeah, there was. It aimed to find out if walking helped focused thinking. Though","words":[["thinking?",219.04,219.56],["Yeah,",220.42,220.86],["there",220.94,221.18],["was.",221.18,221.5],["It",222.16,222.32],["aimed",222.32,222.52],["to",222.52,222.72],["find",222.72,223.02],["out",223.02,223.28],["if",223.28,223.5],["walking",223.5,223.82],["helped",223.82,224.44],["focused",224.44,225.08],["thinking.",225.08,225.6],["Though",226.2,226.58]]},{"start":226.58,"end":229.28,"text":"Well, I wasn't sure that I agreed with their findings.","words":[["Well,",226.58,226.84],["I",226.84,227.02],["wasn't",227.02,227.36],["sure",227.36,227.7],["that",227.7,227.92],["I",227.92,228.08],["agreed",228.08,228.38],["with",228.38,228.62],["their",228.62,228.8],["findings.",228.8,229.28]]},{"start":230.04,"end":233.76,"text":"They decided that walking doesn't help this type of thinking.","words":[["They",230.04,230.38],["decided",230.38,230.94],["that",230.94,231.24],["walking",231.24,231.58],["doesn't",231.58,232.52],["help",232.52,232.78],["this",232.78,233.08],["type",233.08,233.34],["of",233.34,233.48],["thinking.",233.48,233.76]]},{"start":234.3,"end":235.88,"text":"What evidence did they have?","words":[["What",234.3,234.66],["evidence",234.66,235.12],["did",235.12,235.42],["they",235.42,235.6],["have?",235.6,235.88]]},{"start":236.18,"end":237.16,"text":"Well, that's it.","words":[["Well,",236.18,236.42],["that's",236.6,236.98],["it.",236.98,237.16]]},{"start":237.8,"end":242.5,"text":"I don't think there was enough evidence to support their conclusions, even if their","words":[["I",237.8,238.04],["don't",238.04,238.26],["think",238.26,238.46],["there",238.46,238.68],["was",238.68,238.86],["enough",238.86,239.22],["evidence",239.22,239.74],["to",239.74,240.02],["support",240.02,240.4],["their",240.4,240.64],["conclusions,",240.64,241.24],["even",241.72,242.14],["if",242.14,242.32],["their",242.32,242.5]]},{"start":242.5,"end":243.48,"text":"methods were sound.","words":[["methods",242.5,242.86],["were",242.86,243.12],["sound.",243.12,243.48]]},{"start":243.94,"end":248.14,"text":"Well, I'd certainly hesitate before making such a bold statement.","words":[["Well,",243.94,244.36],["I'd",244.82,245.24],["certainly",245.24,245.68],["hesitate",245.68,246.16],["before",246.16,246.58],["making",246.58,246.86],["such",246.86,247.24],["a",247.24,247.42],["bold",247.42,247.64],["statement.",247.64,248.14]]},{"start":248.78,"end":251.04,"text":"Still, it's a first step, isn't it?","words":[["Still,",248.78,249.16],["it's",249.48,249.7],["a",249.7,249.8],["first",249.8,250.06],["step,",250.06,250.5],["isn't",250.58,250.8],["it?",250.8,251.04]]},{"start":251.04,"end":257.58,"text":"I suppose to move forward with this, they'll need to test other ways people keep fit, like","words":[["I",251.04,251.94],["suppose",251.94,252.24],["to",252.24,252.52],["move",252.52,252.74],["forward",252.74,253.32],["with",253.32,253.56],["this,",253.56,253.86],["they'll",254.2,254.52],["need",254.52,254.72],["to",254.72,254.9],["test",254.9,255.2],["other",255.2,255.56],["ways",255.56,255.9],["people",255.9,256.24],["keep",256.24,256.54],["fit,",256.54,256.88],["like",257.22,257.58]]},{"start":257.58,"end":258.12,"text":"swimming.","words":[["swimming.",257.58,258.12]]},{"start":258.72,"end":264.48,"text":"That would be useful, but personally I'd like to know more about the fundamental reason","words":[["That",258.72,259.0],["would",259.0,259.14],["be",259.14,259.32],["useful,",259.32,259.84],["but",260.52,260.76],["personally",260.76,261.44],["I'd",261.44,262.06],["like",262.06,262.2],["to",262.2,262.42],["know",262.42,262.56],["more",262.56,262.8],["about",262.8,263.06],["the",263.06,263.3],["fundamental",263.3,263.8],["reason",263.8,264.48]]},{"start":264.48,"end":266.82,"text":"for the effect on people's creativity.","words":[["for",264.48,264.88],["the",264.88,265.0],["effect",265.0,265.44],["on",265.44,265.74],["people's",265.74,266.22],["creativity.",266.22,266.82]]},{"start":267.28,"end":272.28,"text":"That would be good. Then it could be applied more widely in work, for example.","words":[["That",267.28,267.46],["would",267.46,267.58],["be",267.58,267.74],["good.",267.74,268.04],["Then",268.58,268.92],["it",268.92,269.28],["could",269.28,269.44],["be",269.44,269.66],["applied",269.66,270.02],["more",270.02,270.42],["widely",270.42,270.94],["in",270.94,271.2],["work,",271.2,271.54],["for",271.8,271.92],["example.",271.92,272.28]]},{"start":272.66,"end":275.1,"text":"Again, that's secondary really.","words":[["Again,",272.66,273.22],["that's",273.68,274.26],["secondary",274.26,274.64],["really.",274.64,275.1]]},{"start":275.1,"end":284.26,"text":"Before you hear the rest of the discussion, you have some time to look at questions 27","words":[["Before",275.1,276.08],["you",278.96,279.28],["hear",279.28,279.5],["the",279.5,279.66],["rest",279.66,279.96],["of",279.96,280.1],["the",280.1,280.18],["discussion,",280.18,280.68],["you",281.24,281.46],["have",281.46,281.64],["some",281.64,281.84],["time",281.84,282.2],["to",282.2,282.44],["look",282.44,282.6],["at",282.6,282.74],["questions",282.74,283.14],["27",283.14,284.26]]},{"start":284.26,"end":310.93,"text":"to 30 on page 6. Now listen and answer questions 27 to 30.","words":[["to",284.26,284.72],["30",284.72,285.18],["on",285.18,285.88],["page",285.88,286.1],["6.",286.1,286.54],["Now",306.83,307.27],["listen",307.27,307.61],["and",307.61,308.13],["answer",308.13,308.41],["questions",308.41,308.93],["27",308.93,309.97],["to",309.97,310.47],["30.",310.47,310.93]]},{"start":314.86,"end":319.72,"text":"But how would you test walking if you wanted to assess its physical benefits?","words":[["But",314.86,315.26],["how",315.26,315.76],["would",315.76,315.98],["you",315.98,316.12],["test",316.12,316.44],["walking",316.44,316.82],["if",316.82,317.28],["you",317.28,317.4],["wanted",317.4,317.66],["to",317.66,317.92],["assess",317.92,318.22],["its",318.22,318.58],["physical",318.58,319.12],["benefits?",319.12,319.72]]},{"start":320.58,"end":325.48,"text":"Well, firstly, I'd like to know more about the benefits of different situations.","words":[["Well,",320.58,320.92],["firstly,",321.24,321.8],["I'd",322.16,322.34],["like",322.34,322.56],["to",322.56,322.8],["know",322.8,322.92],["more",322.92,323.26],["about",323.26,323.52],["the",323.52,323.74],["benefits",323.74,324.2],["of",324.2,324.56],["different",324.56,324.82],["situations.",324.82,325.48]]},{"start":326.26,"end":328.08,"text":"What about the effect of footwear?","words":[["What",326.26,326.54],["about",326.54,326.78],["the",326.78,327.0],["effect",327.0,327.34],["of",327.34,327.54],["footwear?",327.54,328.08]]},{"start":328.08,"end":329.84,"text":"Hmm. Hadn't thought of that.","words":[["Hmm.",328.08,328.64],["Hadn't",328.94,329.2],["thought",329.2,329.4],["of",329.4,329.64],["that.",329.64,329.84]]},{"start":330.22,"end":335.32,"text":"Well, I've read that shoes with thinner soles were found to be better for people's joints.","words":[["Well,",330.22,330.44],["I've",330.62,330.94],["read",330.94,331.1],["that",331.1,331.3],["shoes",331.3,331.68],["with",331.68,332.0],["thinner",332.0,332.4],["soles",332.4,332.98],["were",332.98,333.46],["found",333.46,333.66],["to",333.66,333.84],["be",333.84,333.98],["better",333.98,334.32],["for",334.32,334.58],["people's",334.58,335.04],["joints.",335.04,335.32]]},{"start":336.12,"end":338.5,"text":"It even made the skeletal structure tougher.","words":[["It",336.12,336.3],["even",336.3,336.58],["made",336.58,336.86],["the",336.86,337.06],["skeletal",337.06,337.6],["structure",337.6,338.08],["tougher.",338.08,338.5]]},{"start":339.08,"end":342.14,"text":"Interesting. Was that because they lost weight?","words":[["Interesting.",339.08,339.62],["Was",340.3,340.6],["that",340.6,340.86],["because",340.86,341.18],["they",341.18,341.5],["lost",341.5,341.86],["weight?",341.86,342.14]]},{"start":342.5,"end":346.9,"text":"Not as far as I'm aware. And then there's walking in the mountains.","words":[["Not",342.5,342.96],["as",342.96,343.18],["far",343.18,343.44],["as",343.44,343.6],["I'm",343.6,343.8],["aware.",343.8,344.16],["And",344.64,345.28],["then",345.28,345.5],["there's",345.5,345.82],["walking",345.82,346.16],["in",346.16,346.44],["the",346.44,346.54],["mountains.",346.54,346.9]]},{"start":347.42,"end":352.54,"text":"Walking in the mountains? Hmm. I think I've read something about that.","words":[["Walking",347.42,347.76],["in",347.76,348.08],["the",348.08,348.18],["mountains?",348.18,348.76],["Hmm.",349.64,350.02],["I",350.6,350.78],["think",350.78,350.96],["I've",350.96,351.24],["read",351.24,351.44],["something",351.44,351.8],["about",351.8,352.18],["that.",352.18,352.54]]},{"start":353.12,"end":356.64,"text":"Doesn't altitude help people regulate their sleep patterns?","words":[["Doesn't",353.12,353.6],["altitude",353.6,354.22],["help",354.22,354.74],["people",354.74,355.1],["regulate",355.1,355.58],["their",355.58,355.9],["sleep",355.9,356.22],["patterns?",356.22,356.64]]},{"start":357.28,"end":359.92,"text":"It's more that it improves your vision.","words":[["It's",357.28,357.92],["more",357.92,358.34],["that",358.34,358.66],["it",358.66,358.8],["improves",358.8,359.26],["your",359.26,359.52],["vision.",359.52,359.92]]},{"start":360.24,"end":361.82,"text":"It must be those breathtaking views.","words":[["It",360.24,360.54],["must",360.54,360.72],["be",360.72,360.88],["those",360.88,361.04],["breathtaking",361.04,361.5],["views.",361.5,361.82]]},{"start":362.46,"end":362.72,"text":"Yeah.","words":[["Yeah.",362.46,362.72]]},{"start":363.52,"end":367.2,"text":"And what about the effect that walking has for elderly people?","words":[["And",363.52,363.78],["what",363.78,364.22],["about",364.22,364.5],["the",364.5,364.68],["effect",364.68,365.18],["that",365.18,365.4],["walking",365.4,365.76],["has",365.76,366.16],["for",366.16,366.46],["elderly",366.46,366.7],["people?",366.7,367.2]]},{"start":367.82,"end":369.82,"text":"Better balance by any chance?","words":[["Better",367.82,368.16],["balance",368.16,368.96],["by",368.96,369.34],["any",369.34,369.5],["chance?",369.5,369.82]]},{"start":370.26,"end":376.74,"text":"More than that, it had a positive effect by helping them maintain their body clocks natural rhythm,","words":[["More",370.26,370.8],["than",370.8,370.98],["that,",370.98,371.26],["it",371.64,372.12],["had",372.12,372.28],["a",372.28,372.4],["positive",372.4,372.7],["effect",372.7,373.36],["by",373.36,373.64],["helping",373.64,373.96],["them",373.96,374.2],["maintain",374.2,374.66],["their",374.66,375.0],["body",375.0,375.3],["clocks",375.3,375.64],["natural",375.64,376.12],["rhythm,",376.12,376.74]]},{"start":377.02,"end":379.86,"text":"both when going to bed and waking up.","words":[["both",377.02,377.32],["when",377.32,377.68],["going",377.68,377.96],["to",377.96,378.2],["bed",378.2,378.46],["and",378.46,379.2],["waking",379.2,379.52],["up.",379.52,379.86]]},{"start":379.98,"end":380.36,"text":"Right.","words":[["Right.",379.98,380.36]]},{"start":381.02,"end":384.22,"text":"And what about the effect of walking long distances?","words":[["And",381.02,381.66],["what",381.66,381.9],["about",381.9,382.2],["the",382.2,382.4],["effect",382.4,382.72],["of",382.72,382.96],["walking",382.96,383.32],["long",383.32,383.72],["distances?",383.72,384.22]]},{"start":384.22,"end":390.78,"text":"Well, a person needs to find the balance between their optimum speed and their natural breathing","words":[["Well,",384.22,385.12],["a",385.44,385.58],["person",385.58,385.86],["needs",385.86,386.14],["to",386.14,386.38],["find",386.38,386.62],["the",386.62,386.82],["balance",386.82,387.16],["between",387.16,387.64],["their",387.64,388.08],["optimum",388.08,388.48],["speed",388.48,388.92],["and",388.92,389.62],["their",389.62,389.8],["natural",389.8,390.36],["breathing",390.36,390.78]]},{"start":390.78,"end":396.44,"text":"pattern. Once they're synchronised, they can just keep on going for much longer periods","words":[["pattern.",390.78,391.18],["Once",391.72,392.14],["they're",392.14,392.48],["synchronised,",392.48,393.26],["they",393.38,393.52],["can",393.52,393.74],["just",393.74,394.1],["keep",394.1,394.4],["on",394.4,394.62],["going",394.62,394.9],["for",394.9,395.22],["much",395.22,395.48],["longer",395.48,395.82],["periods",395.82,396.44]]},{"start":396.44,"end":397.46,"text":"than they could before.","words":[["than",396.44,396.78],["they",396.78,396.94],["could",396.94,397.06],["before.",397.06,397.46]]},{"start":397.72,"end":401.38,"text":"I can see how that would work. But anyway.","words":[["I",397.72,398.1],["can",398.1,398.98],["see",398.98,399.32],["how",399.32,399.56],["that",399.56,399.72],["would",399.72,399.86],["work.",399.86,400.28],["But",401.04,401.12],["anyway.",401.12,401.38]]},{"start":405.36,"end":442.22,"text":"That is the end of section 3. You now have half a minute to check your answers. Now","words":[["That",405.36,405.82],["is",405.82,406.02],["the",406.02,406.2],["end",406.2,406.46],["of",406.46,406.64],["section",406.64,406.94],["3.",406.94,407.5],["You",408.32,408.5],["now",408.5,408.7],["have",408.7,409.04],["half",409.04,409.42],["a",409.42,409.6],["minute",409.6,409.84],["to",409.84,410.3],["check",410.3,410.6],["your",410.6,410.8],["answers.",410.8,411.22],["Now",441.84,442.22]]},{"start":442.22,"end":444.64,"text":"Now turn to section 4 on page 7.","words":[["Now",442.22,442.3],["turn",442.3,442.5],["to",442.5,442.68],["section",442.68,442.96],["4",442.96,443.5],["on",443.5,444.0],["page",444.0,444.24],["7.",444.24,444.64]]}]}